OL,3,AChurch of England should protect 'every
OL,4,Abelief', King says
OL,5,
OL,6,FKing Charles has said the Church of
OL,7,FEngland does not just protect the
OL,8,FChristian faith, but also the space
OL,9,F"for every belief" within British
OL,10,Fsociety.
OL,12,FHe was speaking in his role as Supreme
OL,13,FGovernor of the Church at the
OL,14,Finauguration of a new term of its
OL,15,Fnational assembly, General Synod.
OL,17,FWhile such comments have caused fierce
OL,18,Ftheological debate in the past, they
OL,19,Fare consistent with the King's
OL,20,Flong-expressed beliefs.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
